<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ food price index falls 0.1 pct in November.</title>
<headline>NZ food price index falls 0.1 pct in November.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Thursday released the following data for the Food Price Index for November:</p>
<p>    Nov 1996	   Oct 1996	     Nov 1995</p>
<p>    -0.1 pct	   +0.4 pct	     +1.0 pct</p>
<p>yr-end Nov 1996  yr-end Oct 1996  yr-end Nov 1995</p>
<p>    +2.1 pct	   +3.2 pct	     +1.8 pct</p>
<p>Note - The index makes up 18 percent of the consumer price index (CPI).</p>
<p>Food subgroups, percentage change from the same month of the previous year:</p>
<p>				    Nov 1996	Oct1996</p>
<p>    Fruit and Vegetables    -2.4 pct	+1.0 pct</p>
<p>    Meat, fish and poultry  +0.9 pct	+1.2 pct</p>
<p>    Grocery food etc	  +3.8 pct	+5.1 pct</p>
<p>    Restaurants		 +2.0 pct	+1.8 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
